Yep, your artifact wish likely failed because of the number of existing 
artifacts. With 3 artifacts generated, wishing for a fourth will only 
work 1/2 of the time; the exact odds are 2 / (1 + number of existing 
artifacts).

Peeking at the source, it looks like you'd get the same message if your 
wished-for artifact already exists (only possible with bones for quest 
artifacts), or is your own quest artifact. Also, AFAICT, there's 
nothing stopping you from wishing for cross-aligned quest artifacts; 
you just won't be able to use them without changing alignment, which'll 
wipe out any and all of your divine protection.
